{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27906","headline":"杭州卢录事山亭 · 朱庆余","name":"杭州卢录事山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山色满公署，到来诗景饶。\n解衣临曲榭，隔竹见红蕉。\n清漏焚香夕，轻岚视事朝。\n静中看锁印，高处见迎潮。\n曳履庭芜近，当身树叶飘。\n傍城余菊在，步入一僊瓢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}